  "title": "Bajaj Finance to launch new term-loan variants from Nov as RBI weighs revolving credit ban",
  "summary": "Since the RBI proposed a ban on revolving credit by NBFCs in its August 6 draft circular, Bajaj Finance, with an estimated 15 per cent of consolidated AUM in such products, is preparing new term-loan variants from 1st November. A complete ban would have a transient impact on AUM and marginally compress NIM and profitability, Vice Chairman & MD Rajeev Jain said.",
